HTTrack 3.50.4: a new copy is no longer held to 25 KB/s.

• A new copy runs at full speed now. One where you set a rate limit keeps it
• A site that asks you to wait is obeyed and retried instead of failing, and you can set the longest wait you accept
• Pages that load JavaScript modules are followed correctly, so modern sites copy more completely
• Only the robots.txt rules meant for HTTrack are applied now